# Verbatim copies of maplibre-gl's shipped worker files, placed by
# scripts/copy-web-assets.mjs. `__tests__/webAssets.test.ts` asserts they are
# byte-identical to their source in node_modules, so git must not rewrite their line
# endings on checkout - CRLF conversion would fail that test on every fresh clone on
# Windows, for a difference that is not real.
public/maplibre/** -text

# Flag artwork copied verbatim from the flag-icons devDependency. Marked binary so git
# does not rewrite line endings on checkout - the files are generated, not edited, and
# the CRLF warning on all 249 of them at every `git add` is pure noise.
public/flags/** -text
